# Nura rc4 candidate; kernel release 7.0.0-sm8150-guacamole-rc4.
# Isolated copy of the reviewed rc3 recipe
# (device/testing/rc3/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8150): the 0001-0041 patch bytes
# are retained verbatim.  This copy adds, for rc4:
#   0044 guacamole MSS rail vote driver (opt-in userspace unit, not in preset);
#   0045 ath10k SNOC WMI key acknowledgement;
#   0046-0050 DisplayPort audio plumbing and diagnostics (inert unless the DP
#        audio DAI link is enabled, and it ships status="disabled");
#   0051 Goodix fingerprint driver (DT node disabled, allow_power defaults off);
#   0052-0054 popup-camera Hall sensors, IMX471 and motor drivers;
#   0055/0056 fingerprint and popup devicetree (both gated, see the DTs);
#   0057/0058 guacamole DisplayPort video nodes and a disabled DP audio link;
#   CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-sm8150-guacamole-rc4", CONFIG_PM_DEBUG,
#   CONFIG_QCOMTEE=m (blacklisted on the kernel cmdline), CONFIG_INPUT_GOODIX_FP=m,
#   CONFIG_QCOM_GUACAMOLE_MSS_VOTE=m, CONFIG_MXM1120/VIDEO_IMX471/
#   VIDEO_QCOM_HOTDOG_POPUP=m.
# rc4i (pkgrel 12) adds:
#   0068-0071 drm/msm recovery backports (forbid memory reclaim under
#        gpu->lock, always recover, recover the HW before retiring the hung
#        submit, task_struct leak) from linux v7.1/v7.3 -- CONFIG_DRM_MSM=y,
#        so they change the Image and its BTF; reinstall the module tree with
#        it even though the release string does not change;
#   0072 guacamole PM8150 PON reboot modes (reboot --reboot-argument=bootloader
#        reaches the ABL as fastboot instead of a warm reset).
# rc4j (pkgrel 13) adds:
#   0073 drm/msm: align kernel-managed GPU VAs to 64 KiB, with a PAGE_SIZE
#        retry on -ENOSPC (freedreno list 2026-11-09 msg48724, questioned by
#        the maintainer).  Experimental candidate for the A640 CCU translation
#        faults: it changes the Image and its BTF, the release string does not
#        change, so reinstall the module tree with it.
# rc4k (pkgrel 14) adds:
#   0074 guacamole NFC on I2C9; ROM-mode reader bring-up, RF unverified.
# rc4l (pkgrel 15) changes:
#   0074 NFC IRQ (GPIO47) bias-pull-down; the pull-up caused an IRQ storm
#        that broke UFS clock scaling (-110). DT only; Image unchanged.
# rc4n (pkgrel 16) adds:
#   0075 guacamole rear autofocus: bind and enable the main/tele LC898217XC
#        actuators with a 0-400 focus range (shortcut, on-unit calibration
#        pending). DT only; kernel code and config unchanged.
# rc4o (pkgrel 17) changes:
#   0044 guacamole_mss_vote also recognises the board through the
#        ABL-quarantine wrapper (root "qcom,sm8150-mtp" plus the
#        samsung,oneplus-dsc panel node); before, it never loaded.
# rc4p (pkgrel 18) adds:
#   0076 lc898217xc: balance runtime PM in s_ctrl and free the controls
#        after parking the lens in remove(). Module code only.
#   0077 camss csid: drop the VFE reference on power-up errors, halt the
#        channel on stream off, poll reset-done and retry once. Module code only.
# rc4q (pkgrel 19) adds:
#   0078 ath10k: offload the GTK rekey to the firmware during WoW, so a
#        suspended phone answers the AP's group key renewal instead of
#        being dropped and woken. Module code only.
# rc4r (pkgrel 20) adds:
#   0079 samsung-oneplus-dsc: prefer the 60 Hz mode and pick the panel's
#        control-display byte by refresh rate, so the console and the
#        compositor start at 60 Hz and shutdown no longer does a full
#        60 -> 90 Hz modeset. Built-in code: needs a new boot image.
# Optional sets (not part of the default build): flows/rc4/optional/<name>,
#   enabled with `./nura kernel --optional <name>` (NURA_KERNEL_OPTIONAL).
#   venus (rc4t, experimental): SM8150 Venus video codec, 49 patches + firmware.
# The canonical rc3 recipe, its scripts and its artifacts are not modified.
# Source prepared by flows/rc4; see flows/rc4/README.md and docs/NURA_RC4.md.
# Co-Maintainer: Viola Guerrera <guerrera.nicola@gmail.com>
maintainer="Pan Ortiz <panjeoc@proton.me>"
